T* (Conformance \(Inferno\), and Governance web application. It operates offline-capable out of the box in Mock Mode with seeded) Tj
T* (synthetic data, and seamlessly switches to Live Mode against local or enterprise HAPI FHIR R4 \(:8081\), eCRNow \(:8080\), .NET) Tj
T* (Integration Gateway \(:5000\), and Inferno \(:4567\).) Tj
